    shortestValidSolution: 'Diabetic kidney disease + albuminuria -> SGLT2 inhibitor restores tubuloglomerular feedback via macula densa Na+ delivery -> afferent arteriolar constriction.',
    necessaryInference: 'Connect SGLT2 inhibition to macula densa sodium delivery and afferent arteriolar constriction, distinguishing from efferent arteriolar dilation (ACEi).',
